Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.73,0:00:03.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,360)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord1\fs18\blur4\3c&H444242&\c&HFAF6EE&\pos(190.545,175.454)}Saturday, July 18th
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.44,0:00:10.28,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Well, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.76,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:15.37,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Good morning, though it is pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:18.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I overslept. Oh, you don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:20.39,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,It's no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:24.75,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:28.30,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Saki is still in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:32.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Is she? That's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:35.01,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Seems she was up late studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:40.06,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I swear, she's gonna catch a cold sleeping\Nwith her tummy exposed and the AC on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:44.94,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It looks like it's going to be \Nanother hot summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:47.23,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,It sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.61,0:02:24.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,610)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H8FCEAB&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 5 {\fs14}"A Late Show and the{\c&H80B7E9&}Real {\c&H8FCEAB&}Deal"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.78,0:02:25.13,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hey, do we have any other copies of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.74,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\an8\c&H8F7E76&\3c&HF7F8F4&\b1\pos(401.273,234.728)\frz352.7}A Rift in\Nthe Blue Night
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.76,0:02:25.74,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\an8\c&H9F90C8&\3c&HF7F8F4&\b1\frz352.7\pos(360.546,271.819)}Animated\NFeature
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:29.88,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Um, there's just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:33.24,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all they sent us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:37.51,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I guess that's not enough to make a stack. \NWant to shelve them upright?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:41.47,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'd rather not have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:44.05,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\an7\pos(146.545,31.818)\3c&H675B5D&\frz6.828\b1}A Rift in the Blue Night
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:44.05,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh. Is it a book you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:48.48,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, it was adapted into a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:56.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,"Just once a week in the park at midnight, \Na boy sees a girl carrying an old violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:00.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Men from her past are chasing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:03.37,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,While unraveling the mystery of the violin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:07.47,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,the boy joins the girl for a journey \Nthrough time and space.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:10.91,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What is the sound that \Nwill change their future?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:11.58,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,270)\fnArial Black\fs30\pos(322.182,115.818)\bord1\frz1.378\c&H434A56&\3c&H181D22&\4c&H181D22&}Over 2 million copies sold
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.91,0:03:14.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,When you finish reading, \Nyou'll want to stand up and yell,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:13.50,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,270)\fnArial Black\fs36\bord1\frz1.378\c&H434A56&\3c&H181D22&\4c&H181D22&\pos(316.364,96.182)}Coming to theaters
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:15.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,'Bravo!'"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:18.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It sounds interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:22.03,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,How about we shelve them facing outward?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.57,0:03:24.51,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess that would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:28.27,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\shad0\an7\3c&H675B5D&\b1\pos(238.909,52.182)}A Rift in the Blue Night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:28.27,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs8\shad0\pos(344,211.091)\fnArial\3c&HF9F8F7&\c&H696969&}A girl he can only meet \Nat midnight. What is that {\c&H4F4D9D&}fateful sound{\c&H696969&}\N drawing them together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:28.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,The movie's still playing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:33.17,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,It ends tomorrow. They'll be \Nreplacing it with summer movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:34.87,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:37.60,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I've got work...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:44.11,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Want to catch a late show \Nafter we finish up tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:48.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,A late show? Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:53.25,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I get off at eight o'clock. Don't you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:55.60,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:58.16,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Saturday nights are perfect \Nfor fooling around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.26,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Phrasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.26,0:04:02.30,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,What? We're just going to see a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.32,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:07.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm interested, too. Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:11.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'll message my parents later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.93,0:04:13.94,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,My, what a wholesome high schooler you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:18.92,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh, you were a high schooler\Nnot that long ago yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.92,0:04:21.62,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,College students are proper adults, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:24.43,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Are you saying you're unwholesome now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:25.70,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Phrasing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:32.38,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,But you know, if you're \Ngoing to message anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.83,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,isn't there someone more \Nimportant than your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:37.35,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Who do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:40.84,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Your little sister. \NWon't she be worried about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:45.87,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Worried about me? No, I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.10,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.10,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\bord0\an7\blur.5\fs8\3c&H675B5D&\b1\pos(128.935,143.715)}A {\fs10\c&HFED16B&}Rift {\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&}in the Blue Night
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.10,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\bord0\an7\blur.5\fs8\3c&H675B5D&\b1\pos(502.649,146.001)}A {\fs10\c&HFED16B&}Rift {\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&}in the Blue Night
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:54.77,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\bord0\an7\blur.5\fs8\3c&H675B5D&\b1\pos(502.649,146.001)}A {\fs10\c&HFED16B&}Rift {\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&}in the Blue Night
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:54.77,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\bord0\an7\blur.5\fs8\3c&H675B5D&\b1\pos(128.935,143.715)}A {\fs10\c&HFED16B&}Rift {\fs8\c&HFFFFFF&}in the Blue Night
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:52.90,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:58.62,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What do you want to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.55,0:05:01.15,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,A Diet Coke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:05.26,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.66,0:05:08.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,The typical movie popcorn and Diet Coke?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:10.76,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I like to stick to the classics.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:15.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,All right, then. Would you like any flavoring?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:17.04,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Caramel all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.51,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.62,0:05:22.05,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:27.22,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,A big bucket! You read my mind, sonny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:29.37,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Is it too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:32.03,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well, you're gonna have some too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.03,0:05:35.21,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't usually snack during the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:37.39,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:40.90,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Don't be like that. Let's eat it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll have a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:43.98,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Up and—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:57.23,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:19.39,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,There's a girl I can only see at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:26.75,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,I need you to take care of this for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:29.38,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Huh? Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:34.85,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,Even if I die, the instrument must live on. \NIt can't fall into the hands of those men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:36.09,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,What men?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:39.22,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,Please! I only have six months left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:41.94,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Wait! Why only six months?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:52.68,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,The truth is, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.27,0:08:07.96,Main - Italics,Man 1,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:10.18,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:13.31,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:16.75,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,My violin is really, really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:23.56,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but those men \Ngive off the same kind of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:24.52,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,They reek of old age?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:28.18,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,No! And that's rude to my violin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.49,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:38.49,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:41.58,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.85,0:08:50.50,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,I've done all I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.81,0:08:53.74,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:56.91,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,I can tell you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:09:01.24,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Isn't there someplace special \Nyou wanted to see at the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:08.15,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,There must be. I mean, isn't that \Nwhat you've been searching for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:13.21,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,I want... I want to see it with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:15.95,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.11,0:09:20.46,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Together. There's still time if we leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:25.90,Main - Italics,Girl,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:43.85,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I owe you one for walking me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.65,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? It's not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:48.61,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's okay. I want to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:05.51,Main - Italics,Vending Machine,0,0,0,,Good evening. It sure is hot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.51,0:10:06.96,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:13.04,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you sure all you want is a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:13.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:15.16,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Want me to open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:16.26,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I can get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:19.62,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Wow, you sure are handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:25.89,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot! I should have recorded that \Nwith my phone so the whole world could see!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:28.76,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'd ask that you respect my privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:31.40,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I bet it would get tons of views, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:34.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's still nothing to brag about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:41.13,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You're really fun, and you're so kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:43.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:45.70,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:55.33,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Listen, my sweet junior. \NThere's something I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:57.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Something you have to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:11:00.43,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yes. Something I want you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:05.06,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,The truth is, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.14,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,only have six months left to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:21.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I can tell you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:25.37,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Let's go. There's still time if we leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:38.51,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:41.28,Main - Italics,Vending Machine,0,0,0,,Good evening. It sure is hot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:50.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:12:00.30,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that the view from here \Nis exactly like that park in the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:04.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh. Yeah, it does look like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:08.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, though, I can't time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:13.83,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess not. Can I toss that can for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:15.26,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:21.70,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Should we get going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:23.26,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:50.76,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'll be okay from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:52.62,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:53.32,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.25,0:12:58.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Thanks again for that \Nmusic you told me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.65,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It made Ayase-san really happy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.89,0:13:05.83,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Be sure to give your dear sister my regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.47,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Up and—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:37.67,Main - Italics,Boy,0,0,0,,Ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:46.80,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Hey, someone put a blanket over \Nme last night. Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:46.46,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,350)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs18\3c&H444242&\c&H000000&\pos(480,195.714)}Sunday, July 19th
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.79,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh. Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.79,0:15:51.51,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:56.30,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be good if you got \Nsick before your retest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:59.81,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.51,0:16:02.68,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You don't need to thank me for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:06.74,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Didn't you go see a movie last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:09.28,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:13.35,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's called {\i1}A Rift in the Blue Night{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:16.78,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I think I saw a commercial for that. How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:22.78,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It was really good. Actually, \NI highly recommend that you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.78,0:16:24.90,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Not until after the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.17,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:29.98,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If it's based on a book, \Nmaybe I'll read that instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:32.68,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It might even help my literature grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:33.84,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:41.70,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So, are you dating that senpai at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:48.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Things aren't like that between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:49.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,They're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:51.89,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,She's just a coworker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.89,0:16:52.69,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.08,0:16:56.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,She likes books, too, \Nso we have a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:17:00.91,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You do read a lot of books, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:03.21,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I should start reading more, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:06.36,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'd love to get another friend into books.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:09.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But you should focus on your test for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:09.67,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:11.71,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.93,0:17:19.72,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hello, my sweet junior!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.67,0:17:21.98,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:24.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Are you restocking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:26.91,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yes. Would you give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:29.63,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.89,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Do you think this is good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:36.71,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:41.68,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, that girl looks like she's looking\N for something. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.77,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Can I help you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:50.32,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yes, a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:51.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.66,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, you're looking for a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:58.53,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Please, allow me to be of assistance!\NI'd love to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:18:01.53,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sure. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:06.05,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me! \NSay, aren't you his little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:09.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Um, yes. And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.66,0:18:11.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:12.40,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yomiuri Shiori. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:17.77,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You're every bit as pretty as he said you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.77,0:18:20.33,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Adorable, just adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.33,0:18:22.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You're acting like some drunk guy at a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:27.63,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Um, Asamura-kun, \NI'm looking for a study guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:28.83,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,If you want a study guide—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.83,0:18:33.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, and also the novel version\Nof the movie you saw yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.58,0:18:37.08,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, are you interested in the movie, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.08,0:18:39.39,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,If so, there's a late show we could—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:42.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san needs to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.11,0:18:44.69,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Don't try to lead her down the path of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:49.19,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,But the flowers along the path of evil are\Nbeautiful because they're watered with blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.19,0:18:51.52,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's clearly inefficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.52,0:18:56.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Flowers grown properly with water \Nand sunlight will always be superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.14,0:19:01.44,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this pointless\Nchit-chat on the clock, my sweet junior!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.44,0:19:05.65,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Our top priority should be pointing our \Nlost customer in the right direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.58,0:19:14.24,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,So anyway, my sweet junior's little sister, \Nabout that book you're looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.24,0:19:16.51,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It's Saki. Ayase Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.51,0:19:17.59,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Ayase?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:23.21,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't mind if you call me Asamura Saki, \Nbut that might make things confusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:25.35,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Please just use my given name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:29.72,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay, then. I'll call you Saki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:34.26,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Now, you're looking for a study guide \Nand the novel the movie's based on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:41.73,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yes. Also, Asamura-kun, are there any \Nother books you'd recommend for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:43.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You want my recommendations?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:48.62,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Since you read so many books, \NI figure you must know some good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:51.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It'll help me study, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:54.78,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh... Okay, I'll pick something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:19:59.13,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Is working the register hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.47,0:20:01.48,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:06.89,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's an endless string of brief conversations\Nwith people you don't necessarily level with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.86,0:20:13.12,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It isn't really that scary, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:15.69,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Next is the study guide, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fay-.16\shad0\fs20\pos(315.429,59.143)\c&HDCDECC&\3c&H715B46&}Now Hiring Part-Timers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fay-.15\shad0\fs10\c&H745741&\3c&HE6E7E5&\pos(316.571,155.143)}If you're interested in books and publishing, why not come work with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnAria\fay-.12\shad0\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&HE6E7E5&\pos(314.285,172.857)}Job Details
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnAria\fay-.13\shad0\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&HE6E7E5&\pos(318.856,193.428)}Duties: Sales, register, stocking, and inventory
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnAria\fay-.12\shad0\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&HE6E7E5&\pos(285.713,209.999)}No prior knowledge required
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnAria\fay-.11\shad0\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&HE6E7E5&\pos(302.284,231.713)}Open Positions: 3
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnAria\fay-.11\shad0\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&HE6E7E5&\pos(255.427,258.57)}Hours:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnAria\fay-.12\shad0\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&HE6E7E5&\pos(333.713,252.856)}Schedule negotiable
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnAria\fay-.12\shad0\fs8\c&H000000&\3c&HE6E7E5&\pos(253.715,294.857)}Days: 2 to 4 days a week
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.15,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnAria\shad0\fs8\fax-.1\c&H745741&\3c&HE6E7E5&\frz6.219\pos(318.858,306.286)}Looking for cheery, energetic individuals.{\c&H000000&} Ask an employee for details.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.95,0:20:19.15,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Take that escalator down one floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:21.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,They'll be on the shelf on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:25.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks for taking the time to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'll grab one and head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:28.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:35.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That apron looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:43.56,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You sure are fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:47.47,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well, I'm used to it. \NYuta-kun is pretty quick, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.96,0:20:51.31,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yuta-kun? Oh, Asamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:21:03.32,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\shad0\fs14\bord1\fay.05\pos(144.571,32.857)\c&H152F49&\3c&H1E5FAD&\frz358.4}Stop Shoplifting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.62,0:20:54.67,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,I always call him my sweet junior, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:20:57.78,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:20:59.94,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.94,0:21:02.40,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,No, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.40,0:21:05.94,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,And for you, Saki-chan, one smile on the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:12.45,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(750,1)\fnArial\fs8\shad0\c&HD3CFDE&\3c&H764367&\b1\pos(435.657,328.476)}Rewards Points Promotion\N{\c&H4830A3&\bord1\3c&H72ABA3&}Earn up to 30%
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:14.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial Black\fs18\frz355.5\pos(233.053,138.693)\frx38\fry350\3c&HA0BCC5&\c&H4E48BB&}Po{\c&HBDB77C&}tato {\c&H4E48BB&}Sal{\c&HBDB77C&}ad
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.64,0:21:14.96,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.67,0:21:18.99,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Your little sister was really cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.99,0:21:21.56,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You're still talking about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:25.74,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,At my age, if you don't maintain a \Nhealthy intake of young girl extract,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:28.62,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,you simply start to shrivel up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:32.55,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You aren't that much older than her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:36.96,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,There's a world of difference between \Nhigh school and college students.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:39.90,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You just don't get it, my sweet junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:43.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I really doubt I ever will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:46.52,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,And Saki-chan's pure and innocent reactions...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.34,0:21:50.36,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,My sweet junior, she might be the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Real deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:53.62,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.17,0:21:59.93,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:02.87,Default,Shiori,0,0,0,,You don't? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:07.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san is still my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:50.03,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H8FCEAB&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 6 {\fs14}"Sweet 'n' Sour Pork and {\c&H80B7E9&}Rain{\c&H8FCEAB&}"
